# note: MSKCC Lilac, cpuqueue on the A100 hosts: CPU only, no GPU, 8 slots, 6 h.
#       A100 hosts carry an exclusive resource (gpu !A100), so LSF sends a job
#       there only when it asks for A100 -- even a CPU-only one. They are often
#       idle while the A40/2080Ti hosts are full. Use beside Lilac_CPU_6h.
--scheduler
lsf
--queue
cpuqueue
--cores
8
--constraint
A100
--walltime
6h
